---

<main class="ics-case" aria-label="Integrated Channels Suite case study">
  <section class="ics-section ics-overview" id="overview" aria-labelledby="ics-overview-title">
    <div class="ics-page ics-overview-page">
      <div class="ics-overview-copy">
        <p class="ics-kicker">DIGITAL BANKING PLATFORM</p>
        <h1 id="ics-overview-title">Integrated<br />Channels Suite</h1>
        <h2>A configurable digital platform<br />for banks and NBFCs.</h2>
        <i class="ics-gradient-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <p class="ics-overview-lede">Integrated Channels Suite is a multi-application banking platform that brings together lending, payments, customer servicing, compliance and other core banking operations. It includes 12 specialized applications that can be deployed individually or as a unified suite, configured to meet each institution’s regulatory and business requirements.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ics-overview-visual" aria-label="Banking platform workspace for desktop and mobile">
        <div class="ics-entity-row">
          <div><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="bank" class="ics-icon tone-blue" /><b>Banks</b><small>Public | Private | Cooperative</small></div>
          <div><IntegratedChannelsIcon glyph="▥" class="ics-icon tone-violet" /><b>NBFCs</b><small>Lending | Housing | Microfinance</small></div>
          <div><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="shield" class="ics-icon tone-green" /><b>Compliance Ready</b><small>RBI, FIU, CKYC, AML, GST and audit requirements</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ics-workspace-scene">
          <article class="ics-callout ics-callout-workflow"><IntegratedChannelsIcon glyph="⚙" class="ics-icon tone-blue" /><b>Configurable<br />Workflows</b><small>Adapt to regulatory and institution-specific requirements.</small></article>
          <article class="ics-callout ics-callout-modular"><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="parallelogram" class="ics-icon tone-violet" /><b>Modular<br />Deployment</b><small>Deploy individual applications or as a unified suite.</small></article>
          <div class="ics-laptop">
            <div class="ics-laptop-screen">
              <aside>
                <b><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="layers" /></b><strong>Integrated<br />Channels</strong>
                <span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="home" />Home</span><span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="grid" />Applications</span>
                <span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="people" />Customers</span><span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="document" />Transactions</span>
                <span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="shield" />Compliance</span><span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="bars" />Reports</span>
              </aside>
              <div class="ics-dashboard">
                <div class="ics-searchbar"><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="search" /><span>Search customer, account or transaction...</span><b><i></i>?　MP</b></div>
                <h3>Banking Overview</h3>
                <div class="ics-quick-stats">
                  <span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="people" /><b>Customers</b></span><span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="card" /><b>Accounts</b></span>
                  <span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="columns" /><b>Loans</b></span><span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="arrow" /><b>Payments</b></span>
                </div>
                <div class="ics-dashboard-panels"><article><b>Application Activity</b><div class="ics-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></article><article><b>Operational Status</b><div class="ics-donut"></div><small><span class="status-online"></span>Applications Online<br /><span class="status-maintenance"></span>Under Maintenance<br /><span class="status-scheduled"></span>Scheduled</small></article></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ics-laptop-base"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="ics-phone">
            <div class="ics-phone-top"><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="layers" />Integrated Channels <b><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="menu" /></b></div>
            <b>Quick Actions</b>
            <div class="ics-phone-actions"><span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="people" /><small>Customer</small></span><span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="card" /><small>Loan</small></span><span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="arrow" /><small>Payment</small></span><span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="shield" /><small>Compliance</small></span><span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="document" /><small>Reports</small></span><span><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="more" /><small>More</small></span></div>
            <b>Recent Activities</b>
            <p><i class="ics-activity-dot blue"></i>Loan Application<br /><small>In Progress</small></p><p><i class="ics-activity-dot green"></i>Payment Processed<br /><small>Successful</small></p><p><i class="ics-activity-dot navy"></i>CKYC Validation<br /><small>Completed</small></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ics-overview-pillars">
        {overviewPillars.map(([, title, text, tone], index) => <article class={`tone-${tone}`}><IntegratedChannelsIcon name={overviewPillarIconNames[index]} class="ics-icon" /><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></div></article>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ics-section ics-ecosystem" id="ecosystem" aria-labelledby="ics-ecosystem-title">
    <div class="ics-page ics-ecosystem-page">
      <aside class="ics-dark-panel ics-ecosystem-story">
        <p class="ics-kicker">DIGITAL BANKING ECOSYSTEM</p>
        <h2 id="ics-ecosystem-title">A connected product ecosystem for <em>banks</em> and <em>NBFCs.</em></h2>
        <i class="ics-gradient-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <p>Brings together 12 configurable banking applications on a common platform with shared controls, reporting, and institution-specific workflows.</p>
        <article><IntegratedChannelsIcon glyph="▱" class="ics-icon tone-blue" /><div><b>12 specialised applications</b><small>Core banking, compliance, operations and customer functions.</small></div></article>
        <article><IntegratedChannelsIcon glyph="⚙" class="ics-icon tone-green" /><div><b>Common platform controls</b><small>Unified user management, security, audit, reporting and monitoring.</small></div></article>
        <article><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="sliders" class="ics-icon tone-violet" /><div><b>Configurable institution workflows</b><small>Tailored to bank or NBFC business processes and regulatory needs.</small></div></article>
      </aside>
      <div class="ics-ecosystem-board" aria-label="The twelve connected Integrated Channels Suite applications">
        <svg class="ics-ecosystem-connectors" viewBox="0 0 1000 700" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke-width="5"><path d="M500 350 C420 230 260 130 145 85" stroke="#8b36ed"/><path d="M500 350 C500 190 500 130 500 85" stroke="#087ff0"/><path d="M500 350 C580 230 740 130 855 85" stroke="#00a986"/><path d="M500 350 C700 270 800 210 855 210" stroke="#e72c82"/><path d="M500 350 C720 350 790 350 855 350" stroke="#087ff0"/><path d="M500 350 C700 440 800 490 855 490" stroke="#8139ed"/><path d="M500 350 C580 500 740 570 855 600" stroke="#ff9400"/><path d="M500 350 C500 520 500 570 500 600" stroke="#ed2580"/><path d="M500 350 C420 500 260 570 145 600" stroke="#087ff0"/><path d="M500 350 C300 440 200 490 145 490" stroke="#00a986"/><path d="M500 350 C280 350 210 350 145 350" stroke="#ff9400"/><path d="M500 350 C300 270 200 210 145 210" stroke="#8139ed"/></g></svg>
        {apps.map((app, index) => <button class:list={['ics-eco-node', `ics-node-${index + 1}`]} type="button" data-open={app.id} style={`--app-tone:${ecosystemTones[app.id] ?? app.color}`} aria-label={`Open ${displayName[app.id] ?? app.name} product workspace`}><IntegratedChannelsIcon name={ecosystemIcons[app.id]} class="ics-icon" /><span class="ics-eco-text"><small>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</small><b>{displayName[app.id] ?? app.name}</b><em>{displayCategory[app.id] ?? app.category}</em></span></button>)}
        <div class="ics-ecosystem-hub"><IntegratedChannelsIcon name="bank" /><b>Integrated<br />Channels Suite</b><small>12 applications · shared platform · configurable workflows</small></div>
        <p class="ics-ecosystem-note">Applications could be accessed individually from the suite to open their dedicated workflows and product details.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ics-section ics-challenge" id="challenge" aria-labelledby="ics-challenge-title">
    <div class="ics-page ics-challenge-page">
      <div class="ics-challenge-copy">
        <p class="ics-kicker">THE CHALLENGE</p>
        <h2 id="ics-challenge-title">Why a Unified Platform was <em>Needed?</em></h2>
        <p>Banks and NBFCs were operating with multiple standalone systems across lending, payments, compliance and operations, leading to inefficiencies, higher operational effort and slower time-to-market.</p>
